* LTC4281 12V HOT SWAP CONTROLLER - INRUSH CONTROLLED TURN-ON INTO RESISTIVE LOAD
* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Genuine LTC4281 subcircuit is used (model shipped in LTspice lib\sub).
* Assumed subcircuit pin order (functional order of the LTC4281 symbol):
*   VDD SENSE GATE SOURCE OUT GND INTVCC OV UV FB ON EN
*   ADIN ADIN2 GPIO1 GPIO2 GPIO3 ALERT SDAI SDAO SCL ADR0 ADR1 ADR2
* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.lib LTC4281.sub

*** 12V backplane supply (board insertion modelled as a fast supply ramp) ***
VIN IN 0 PWL(0 0 200u 12)
CIN IN 0 1u

*** Current sense resistor : 5 mohm  (5A limit at 25mV sense threshold) ***
RSENSE IN SW 5m

*** External N-channel pass MOSFET ***
M1 SW GATE OUT OUT PWRNMOS W=1m L=1u
.model PWRNMOS NMOS(VTO=2.0 KP=20 LAMBDA=5m CGSO=1n CGDO=200p)

*** Gate (dV/dt / inrush) timing capacitor ***
CGATE GATE 0 10n

*** Output rail : bulk capacitance + resistive load (1A at 12V) ***
COUT OUT 0 100u
RLOAD OUT 0 12

*** Input UV / OV programming string (UV ~11.5V rising, OV ~13.8V) ***
RUV1 IN UV 100k
RUV2 UV OV 2k
ROV2 OV 0 10k

*** Output voltage feedback (power good comparator) ***
RFB1 OUT FB 100k
RFB2 FB 0 12.1k

*** ADC auxiliary inputs ***
RA1 OUT ADIN 100k
RA2 ADIN 0 10k
RB1 IN ADIN2 100k
RB2 ADIN2 0 10k

*** ON / EN control : ON held high through divider, EN pulled to INTVCC ***
RON1 IN ON 100k
RON2 ON 0 20k
REN EN INTVCC 10k

*** Internal regulator bypass ***
CVCC INTVCC 0 1u

*** I2C / ALERT / GPIO pull-ups, address pins strapped low ***
RP1 SDAI INTVCC 10k
RP2 SDAO INTVCC 10k
RP3 SCL  INTVCC 10k
RP4 ALERT INTVCC 10k
RG1 GPIO1 INTVCC 10k
RG2 GPIO2 0 10k
RG3 GPIO3 0 10k

*** LTC4281 hot swap controller ***
XU1 IN SW GATE OUT OUT 0 INTVCC OV UV FB ON EN
+    ADIN ADIN2 GPIO1 GPIO2 GPIO3 ALERT SDAI SDAO SCL 0 0 0 LTC4281

*** Analysis ***
.tran 0 100m 0 10u
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 80m TO 100m
.meas TRAN iinrush MAX I(RSENSE) FROM 0 TO 50m
.options plotwinsize=0 gmin=1e-11 reltol=1e-4

.end
